WEBVTT

00:11.968 --> 00:18.016
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

00:18.944 --> 00:21.653
♪The reflection in your eyes♪

00:22.498 --> 00:27.040
♪A brilliant scenery♪

00:27.744 --> 00:33.518
♪Moonlight spills over
the endless clear sky♪

00:34.349 --> 00:42.496
♪The roar of the heartbeat
leaves a trace behind♪

00:44.032 --> 00:49.566
♪Crush, when night meets dawn♪

00:51.616 --> 00:57.786
♪Crush, rushing to you in the crowd♪

00:59.520 --> 01:02.624
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

01:03.040 --> 01:07.085
♪Fervent, boiling love♪

01:07.776 --> 01:11.760
♪How you long for the future♪

01:12.128 --> 01:15.328
♪Charging recklessly, getting hurt♪

01:15.520 --> 01:18.475
♪Fall in my heart♪

01:18.475 --> 01:22.816
♪If tears fill your eyes♪

01:23.328 --> 01:27.297
♪Let the damp wind stay in memories♪

01:27.566 --> 01:33.940
♪We stand by each other among the crowd♪

01:33.940 --> 01:39.040
=Be Passionately in Love=

01:40.640 --> 01:42.868
=Episode 11=
(Happy Birthday, Architect Xu)

01:47.616 --> 01:49.616
Stop worrying about me.
Worry about yourself.

01:50.136 --> 01:51.216
There is an emergency.

01:51.296 --> 01:52.296
Over.

02:03.857 --> 02:05.296
Put it down.

02:05.857 --> 02:07.096
Gu Yan.

02:14.537 --> 02:16.017
You're close to Chen Luzhou.

02:16.656 --> 02:18.817
Is the thing between
her and Luzhou true or not?

02:18.817 --> 02:19.817
What thing?

02:21.057 --> 02:22.096
Of course, it's not true.

02:22.377 --> 02:23.656
Rumors, don't believe that.

02:24.576 --> 02:25.616
Don't believe that.

02:25.616 --> 02:26.736
Stop being stubborn, Zhu.

02:26.857 --> 02:28.256
It's spread at the WeChat group.

02:29.017 --> 02:30.096
Besides,

02:30.096 --> 02:31.136
if they're not dating,

02:31.457 --> 02:33.417
then it's Gu Yan
having a crush on Chen Luzhou.

02:33.417 --> 02:34.417
Is it possible?

02:34.576 --> 02:36.216
A beauty is throwing herself at him.

02:36.216 --> 02:37.216
Is it possible?

02:37.576 --> 02:39.176
What's so good about Gu Yan?

02:39.897 --> 02:41.017
She's in showbiz.

02:41.937 --> 02:43.576
I heard most
of their private lives are...

02:45.377 --> 02:46.377
I admit

02:46.576 --> 02:47.616
she is good-looking.

02:48.417 --> 02:50.937
But it's of no use.
She just has a pretty face.

02:51.057 --> 02:52.576
Who likes a dumb woman, right?

02:52.857 --> 02:53.857
Yingying,

02:54.256 --> 02:55.857
do you know how to choose a man?

02:56.616 --> 02:57.616
How?

02:58.337 --> 02:59.457
When choosing a man,

02:59.696 --> 03:00.657
just see

03:00.657 --> 03:01.977
if his bottom is perky.

03:02.897 --> 03:04.377
People with perky bottom run fast.

03:04.616 --> 03:06.897
If there's a discount
in the supermarket when they're old,

03:07.656 --> 03:10.417
he will run ahead when grabbing eggs.

03:24.937 --> 03:25.937
I disagree.

03:26.576 --> 03:27.817
The men you just mentioned

03:27.817 --> 03:28.817
are poor guys.

03:29.057 --> 03:30.216
When wealthy men grow old,

03:30.216 --> 03:31.656
do they need to run for eggs?

03:32.736 --> 03:34.576
I usually assess a man by his chest.

03:34.937 --> 03:37.296
Hugging a man
with a broad and solid chest

03:38.296 --> 03:39.736
feels secure.

03:41.176 --> 03:42.176
There's one more thing.

03:42.576 --> 03:44.776
What other benefits
does a man with a big chest have?

03:45.417 --> 03:46.457
I don't know.

03:46.457 --> 03:47.457
I never hugged one.

03:49.576 --> 03:50.576
Let me tell you.

03:51.216 --> 03:54.256
He is especially attractive
while wearing a vacuum suit.

03:57.417 --> 03:58.817
Being in a relationship

03:59.176 --> 04:01.017
means facing the same face every day.

04:01.017 --> 04:02.057
You will become tiresome.

04:02.857 --> 04:04.696
If he doesn't find new ways
to please you,

04:05.377 --> 04:06.377
then who would go home?

04:08.457 --> 04:10.656
Lucy, your future looks bleak.

04:11.096 --> 04:12.377
You have to wear a vacuum suit

04:12.377 --> 04:13.776
and head to the store for eggs.

04:19.497 --> 04:20.616
What are you talking about?

04:24.256 --> 04:25.256
So,

04:25.417 --> 04:27.377
a good-looking man is useless

04:27.817 --> 04:28.817
without intelligence.

04:29.296 --> 04:31.296
My mom said you can tell if a man

04:31.296 --> 04:32.057
is smart

04:32.176 --> 04:33.897
by looking at his forehead.

04:33.897 --> 04:35.377
If it's broad,

04:35.736 --> 04:37.017
then he is smart.

04:37.656 --> 04:40.256
If it's short and narrow,

04:43.256 --> 04:44.337
then he's a foolish man.

04:44.417 --> 04:46.256
Who would like a foolish man?

04:46.576 --> 04:47.576
Anything else to say?

04:48.296 --> 04:48.897
No.

04:49.096 --> 04:50.096
Get up and apologize.

04:54.857 --> 04:55.857
- Sorry.
- Sorry.

04:56.136 --> 04:57.136
- Sorry.
- We were wrong.

04:57.537 --> 04:58.537
No need to tell me.

04:58.817 --> 04:59.817
Apologize to her.

05:03.296 --> 05:04.616
Sorry, we were wrong.

05:05.176 --> 05:05.978
Sorry.

05:05.978 --> 05:07.576
We were all just hearing rumors.

05:31.960 --> 05:34.176
Do you know how Luzhou and I
got to know each other?

05:35.417 --> 05:37.977
We had to write papers
for a practice in high school.

05:38.096 --> 05:40.296
I had to film,
and I didn't have time to write,

05:40.696 --> 05:41.696
nor did I know how.

05:42.017 --> 05:44.817
No one wanted to team up with me,
being afraid I'd hold them back.

05:47.096 --> 05:48.096
Only he was willing.

05:49.337 --> 05:51.656
I initially thought he liked me.

05:51.897 --> 05:53.017
But later, I found out

05:53.417 --> 05:54.736
he didn't like being disturbed.

05:55.736 --> 05:56.817
By grouping with me,

05:57.256 --> 05:58.497
he could finish the tasks

05:58.817 --> 05:59.817
on his own as he hopes.

06:00.656 --> 06:01.897
It's something he would do.

06:03.857 --> 06:05.417
Actually, what I want to say is

06:05.977 --> 06:08.057
Chen Luzhou is boundary-conscious.

06:08.696 --> 06:09.897
Especially with girls,

06:10.216 --> 06:11.776
he always keeps a distance.

06:12.337 --> 06:12.937
I understand.

06:13.337 --> 06:14.417
He's a role model for men.

06:14.817 --> 06:16.457
Some nearly strip
when playing basketball.

06:16.696 --> 06:19.017
He wears a white T-shirt
under his basketball uniform,

06:19.377 --> 06:20.656
for fear of exposure.

06:23.417 --> 06:25.296
So, what they just said are all rumors.

06:25.296 --> 06:26.296
Don't take it to heart.

06:27.176 --> 06:28.176
I know.

06:28.817 --> 06:29.857
But you don't know.

06:30.017 --> 06:31.457
Such a proud person like him

06:32.377 --> 06:33.776
actually has a crush on you.

06:36.417 --> 06:38.497
Even if he's not sure
about your feelings.

06:39.937 --> 06:41.377
So, you like her?

06:45.176 --> 06:46.377
Does she like you?

06:50.817 --> 06:52.017
That's none of your business.

06:54.457 --> 06:55.457
Xu Zhi.

06:56.457 --> 06:57.696
I admire few people.

06:58.497 --> 06:59.497
You're one of them.

07:05.017 --> 07:06.216
Cherish Chen Luzhou.

07:12.536 --> 07:14.818
(Movie-themed Cafe)

07:31.288 --> 07:33.790
♪In the darkness,
you are like fireworks♪

07:34.040 --> 07:35.736
♪Unattainable♪

07:35.736 --> 07:36.736
Chen Luzhou.

07:37.176 --> 07:38.176
You can't handle it.

07:39.216 --> 07:40.656
You are not serious, right?

07:42.136 --> 07:43.377
Who can't handle it?

07:44.776 --> 07:46.057
Don't you ignore WeChat text?

07:46.936 --> 07:49.096
♪Peel away the soft shell♪

07:49.096 --> 07:50.736
(No wonder he got mad when I said)

07:51.136 --> 07:52.176
(he couldn't handle it.)

07:52.440 --> 07:55.174
♪The sky will have the morning sun♪

07:55.896 --> 07:59.583
♪And you always have me♪

08:00.248 --> 08:01.912
♪Don't be afraid,
what you've experienced♪

08:01.912 --> 08:04.106
♪Remains in the heart♪

08:04.736 --> 08:05.736
Hey.

08:05.977 --> 08:07.377
Hey, what are you doing?

08:07.696 --> 08:08.696
Working.

08:09.337 --> 08:10.457
When will you finish?

08:11.457 --> 08:13.096
Why? Do you want
to invite me to a movie?

08:14.337 --> 08:15.337
Another day.

08:15.817 --> 08:17.817
How about I treat you
to a late-night snack first?

08:19.496 --> 08:20.496
Sure.

08:21.336 --> 08:22.336
See you later.

08:22.496 --> 08:23.496
Okay.

08:34.584 --> 08:36.958
(Dandan's pan-fried buns)

08:43.977 --> 08:45.336
Pig ears are ready.

08:45.336 --> 08:46.376
- Here, Zhi.
- Thank you.

08:46.376 --> 08:47.376
Your pan-fried buns.

08:47.657 --> 08:48.657
Hasn't he arrived yet?

08:48.857 --> 08:49.857
Yeah.

08:50.057 --> 08:51.057
Oh, my.

08:51.977 --> 08:53.216
Have him eat more later.

08:57.376 --> 08:57.937
Sorry.

08:58.336 --> 08:59.617
Finally here, Poet Chen.

09:00.336 --> 09:01.296
Ten minutes late.

09:01.296 --> 09:02.296
Punish you to eat extra.

09:02.737 --> 09:03.737
Dandan.

09:06.057 --> 09:07.136
You're waiting for him?

09:07.977 --> 09:09.536
You know how long she waited for you?

09:10.577 --> 09:11.857
How can a boy be like this?

09:12.577 --> 09:13.617
Be careful next time.

09:13.977 --> 09:15.336
Sorry, it won't happen again.

09:16.136 --> 09:17.697
- Want pan-fried buns?
- Pan-fried buns.

09:17.977 --> 09:18.977
Okay.

09:20.496 --> 09:21.536
He's called Dandan?

09:22.456 --> 09:23.937
Can't a boy be called Dandan?

09:24.136 --> 09:25.577
Gender bias isn't allowed.

09:28.017 --> 09:29.017
Here, pan-fried buns.

09:29.937 --> 09:30.937
Thank you, Dandan.

09:39.456 --> 09:41.456
Have you ever waited here
for another boy?

09:42.857 --> 09:43.897
You buy this stall,

09:43.897 --> 09:44.937
and ask him yourself.

09:45.617 --> 09:46.857
He knows everything.

09:47.256 --> 09:48.376
Come, eat while it's hot.

09:49.937 --> 09:50.937
Thanks.

09:57.136 --> 09:58.136
Wait.

09:58.216 --> 09:59.817
Something is off.

10:00.376 --> 10:01.376
Do you need a favor?

10:03.136 --> 10:05.857
Then you've done something wrong,
and seek to compensate me.

10:05.937 --> 10:06.937
Do you still want to eat?

10:07.256 --> 10:08.256
Yes.

10:13.336 --> 10:14.336
Is it hot?

10:14.617 --> 10:15.617
Is it good?

10:16.176 --> 10:17.456
As expected from your top pick.

10:17.897 --> 10:18.897
Delicious.

10:22.416 --> 10:23.456
Why aren't you eating?

10:23.456 --> 10:25.136
Isn't this plate of buns for you?

10:25.136 --> 10:25.898
It's yours.

10:25.898 --> 10:27.416
I had two plates of them earlier.

10:27.697 --> 10:28.697
Such a big appetite.

10:30.096 --> 10:31.376
The restaurant Feng Jin picked

10:31.376 --> 10:32.376
isn't that great either.

10:32.817 --> 10:33.817
True.

10:34.456 --> 10:35.737
Those male guests chosen

10:35.737 --> 10:36.977
aren't anything good.

10:39.496 --> 10:41.536
You didn't come,
yet you know so much gossip.

10:42.897 --> 10:44.336
You had to take action there.

10:45.057 --> 10:47.216
But those guys do need to be dealt with.

10:53.777 --> 10:54.857
What did Gu Yan ask?

10:55.977 --> 10:57.416
Don't ask much about girls' issues.

10:58.176 --> 10:59.777
My birthday is on the 8th. Coming?

11:00.456 --> 11:01.456
The 8th...

11:03.977 --> 11:05.136
I have other things to do

11:05.737 --> 11:06.737
and might not go.

11:07.416 --> 11:08.416
Alright.

11:10.176 --> 11:11.216
I haven't told you, right?

11:12.697 --> 11:15.296
Before my College Entrance Exam,
my dad was scammed 100,000 yuan.

11:17.096 --> 11:18.376
Although we've filed a case,

11:18.376 --> 11:20.416
that money is probably unrecoverable.

11:21.296 --> 11:22.697
I told him before.

11:23.017 --> 11:24.017
I told him

11:24.176 --> 11:25.376
to sell his old car,

11:25.376 --> 11:27.256
and add 100,000 yuan to buy a new car.

11:28.096 --> 11:29.057
He couldn't bear to.

11:29.057 --> 11:30.057
Now he really regrets it.

11:30.176 --> 11:30.937
Because why?

11:31.176 --> 11:32.216
This car

11:32.216 --> 11:32.697
is gone,

11:32.977 --> 11:33.977
along with the money.

11:34.376 --> 11:35.657
He lost both people and money.

11:37.096 --> 11:38.937
So, I told you before

11:38.937 --> 11:40.296
thinking too much is useless.

11:40.817 --> 11:42.057
You should enjoy the moment.

11:45.256 --> 11:46.256
I really can't go.

11:46.577 --> 11:47.577
It's not that I'm angry.

11:49.136 --> 11:49.697
Thank you.

11:49.937 --> 11:50.937
What's wrong?

11:53.176 --> 11:56.737
I have some good news.
Your admission letter has arrived.

11:59.057 --> 11:59.618
Next Friday,

11:59.618 --> 12:01.336
your grandma is planning to celebrate.

12:02.456 --> 12:03.456
Next Friday?

12:03.992 --> 12:07.040
(Xu Zhi's birthday)

12:09.577 --> 12:10.577
Can it be on another day?

12:11.456 --> 12:12.456
Another day?

12:13.096 --> 12:14.256
What urgent matter is it

12:14.897 --> 12:16.416
requires an elder to change the date?

12:18.577 --> 12:19.537
Next time this happens,

12:19.537 --> 12:20.737
just inform me directly.

12:21.456 --> 12:22.577
Don't call me back

12:22.937 --> 12:24.136
as if you can discuss with me.

12:28.977 --> 12:29.977
Chen Luzhou.

12:30.416 --> 12:31.657
What's your attitude?

12:32.977 --> 12:34.737
It's okay, family matters are important.

12:38.657 --> 12:39.457
And who told you

12:39.457 --> 12:40.617
I can't enjoy the moment?

12:43.256 --> 12:44.256
Xu Zhi.

12:46.017 --> 12:47.296
You can't beat me.

12:49.592 --> 12:51.256
♪On a midsummer night♪

12:51.256 --> 12:52.256
Are you sure?

12:52.280 --> 12:54.176
♪The drowsy streetlights
softly start to mend♪

12:54.176 --> 12:56.057
I can't wait to experience,

12:56.857 --> 12:58.176
Poet Chen.

12:58.968 --> 13:02.335
♪The moonlight
penetrates the tree shades♪

13:02.872 --> 13:07.384
♪Chasing the distance
between you and me♪

13:42.096 --> 13:43.536
Excuse me.

13:43.657 --> 13:44.817
I'm from the next room.

13:45.416 --> 13:46.257
I was lost in a game,

13:46.257 --> 13:49.096
looking for a girl
to sing a love song duet.

13:51.256 --> 13:52.577
Happy birthday.

13:54.536 --> 13:56.096
You're the birthday girl.

13:56.977 --> 13:58.296
Would you like to sing

13:58.296 --> 14:01.376
a love song duet with me?

14:01.737 --> 14:03.057
- Me?
- I'll sing with you.

14:03.296 --> 14:04.456
I'm best at love songs.

14:04.456 --> 14:06.136
- What do you want to sing?
- No.

14:06.136 --> 14:07.097
Yingying is tone-deaf.

14:07.097 --> 14:08.256
I'm not tone-deaf.

14:09.496 --> 14:10.496
I'll sing with you.

14:10.577 --> 14:12.897
Two guys singing a love song duet

14:13.737 --> 14:14.658
isn't very suitable.

14:14.658 --> 14:16.216
No one is more suitable than me.

14:35.737 --> 14:37.496
He's overdoing it, isn't he?

14:37.897 --> 14:38.817
Bear with it.

14:38.817 --> 14:40.256
It's better than you singing.

14:40.256 --> 14:41.256
What do you mean?

14:41.617 --> 14:43.536
If you sing a love song duet
with someone else,

14:43.857 --> 14:44.977
Chen Luzhou might...

14:49.937 --> 14:51.057
I've completed my task.

14:51.496 --> 14:53.256
You guys have fun. I'm off.

14:53.657 --> 14:54.657
Don't go.

14:54.897 --> 14:56.057
Welcome everyone.

14:56.057 --> 14:56.977
Welcome.

14:56.977 --> 14:58.017
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

14:58.017 --> 14:59.057
Great news.

14:59.456 --> 15:00.857
Luzhou is such an outstanding child

15:00.857 --> 15:02.456
because of your good teaching.

15:02.697 --> 15:03.697
Right.

15:08.336 --> 15:10.017
Come, sit down, let's eat.

15:10.017 --> 15:11.017
Sit.

15:11.336 --> 15:12.057
Alright.

15:12.296 --> 15:13.296
Come, eat.

15:14.737 --> 15:16.496
Speaking of my grandson,

15:16.496 --> 15:18.176
he's been well-behaved, sensible

15:18.176 --> 15:19.577
and articulate since childhood.

15:19.657 --> 15:20.216
Right?

15:20.617 --> 15:23.017
He really hasn't worried us, has he?

15:23.456 --> 15:24.937
It's all because of his own efforts.

15:24.937 --> 15:25.336
Right.

15:25.496 --> 15:26.496
Zhou.

15:26.977 --> 15:28.456
You're about to go abroad.

15:28.617 --> 15:29.817
You'll be alone there.

15:30.136 --> 15:32.216
You'll definitely miss us, won't you?

15:32.657 --> 15:34.376
You'll miss the home-cooked dish.

15:34.777 --> 15:37.136
I made you

15:37.136 --> 15:38.136
a home-cooked dish.

15:38.777 --> 15:39.376
How nice.

15:39.376 --> 15:40.376
Mei.

15:41.096 --> 15:42.096
Serve the dish.

15:42.336 --> 15:43.336
Coming.

15:44.096 --> 15:45.096
Luzhou.

15:45.777 --> 15:46.698
Your grandma made this

15:46.698 --> 15:48.057
home-cooked dish today.

15:48.657 --> 15:49.657
Try it.

15:49.777 --> 15:50.297
Try it.

15:50.297 --> 15:51.617
Yes, eat some.

15:51.617 --> 15:52.617
Eat some.

15:54.136 --> 15:56.496
You won't get to eat this abroad.

15:56.496 --> 15:57.496
Right.

15:58.977 --> 16:01.136
Luzhou can't eat peanuts,
doesn't she know?

16:04.737 --> 16:05.737
Come on.

16:05.817 --> 16:07.617
Luzhou, why aren't you eating?

16:10.657 --> 16:12.657
Do you think my cooking isn't good?

16:15.096 --> 16:16.096
Grandma.

16:16.296 --> 16:17.456
Did you forget

16:17.817 --> 16:19.136
he is allergic to peanuts?

16:21.456 --> 16:22.697
You're so picky.

16:23.977 --> 16:24.977
It's okay, grandma.

16:25.057 --> 16:26.057
I...

16:26.456 --> 16:27.456
I'll have chicken.

16:32.617 --> 16:33.617
Come on.

16:33.737 --> 16:35.096
I haven't prepared much either.

16:35.256 --> 16:36.057
Just a red envelope.

16:36.057 --> 16:36.456
Don't.

16:36.657 --> 16:37.096
Ours too.

16:37.096 --> 16:38.096
It's for the child.

16:38.096 --> 16:39.096
You are so kind.

16:39.817 --> 16:40.657
Thank you, Auntie,

16:40.657 --> 16:42.618
- Take it.
- and Uncle. Thanks.

16:42.618 --> 16:44.657
No need for bringing a red envelope.

16:45.176 --> 16:45.737
Luzhou.

16:46.136 --> 16:47.058
- Hurry.
- Propose a toast.

16:47.058 --> 16:48.296
- Propose a toast.
- Propose a toast.

16:48.496 --> 16:50.416
- Propose a toast.
- Propose a toast.

16:51.017 --> 16:52.017
Luzhou.

16:52.136 --> 16:53.296
You're an adult now.

16:54.536 --> 16:56.096
It's rare for the family to gather.

16:56.336 --> 16:56.977
Drink some.

16:57.176 --> 16:58.617
It's okay to drink some.

16:58.617 --> 17:00.296
He's still a kid.

17:00.296 --> 17:01.296
It's okay to drink some.

17:03.057 --> 17:04.057
Uncle, Aunt, and Auntie.

17:04.216 --> 17:05.296
I've something to do later.

17:05.897 --> 17:06.897
I'll drink tea instead.

17:07.336 --> 17:07.697
Okay.

17:07.697 --> 17:08.176
Thank you.

17:08.416 --> 17:08.817
Come on.

17:08.897 --> 17:09.297
Thanks.

17:09.297 --> 17:10.416
- Come on.
- Have a safe journey.

17:10.416 --> 17:11.577
Thank you. Thanks, Auntie.

17:11.577 --> 17:12.577
Congratulations.

17:14.857 --> 17:19.937
♪If a heavy rain falls♪

17:22.496 --> 17:26.057
♪Let me♪

17:26.737 --> 17:29.777
♪become the ocean♪

17:30.216 --> 17:33.057
♪Those who seem♪

17:33.336 --> 17:34.977
♪to bind♪

17:34.977 --> 17:38.536
♪are about love♪

17:38.697 --> 17:42.937
♪Every wave♪

17:46.817 --> 17:49.536
♪Happy Birthday to You♪

17:49.536 --> 17:52.897
♪Happy Birthday to You♪

17:52.897 --> 17:57.296
♪Happy Birthday to You♪

17:57.777 --> 18:01.456
♪Happy Birthday to You♪

18:01.456 --> 18:02.897
- Make a wish.
- Thank you.

18:03.617 --> 18:04.888
- Happy birthday.
- Happy birthday.

18:10.216 --> 18:13.256
Wish you a happy birthday.

18:16.697 --> 18:18.216
(Birthday wishes have all been made.)

18:18.216 --> 18:19.216
(Where are you?)

18:23.496 --> 18:25.416
Come, eat more.

18:25.737 --> 18:26.256
Eat more.

18:26.737 --> 18:27.778
- Okay.
- Come on.

18:27.778 --> 18:29.617
- Don't be polite.
- You can drink a lot.

18:29.737 --> 18:30.376
Cheers.

18:30.697 --> 18:33.096
Grandma, I really have to leave first.

18:34.376 --> 18:35.617
Elders, I might...

18:35.617 --> 18:36.817
What's so important?

18:37.176 --> 18:38.176
Can't it be another day?

18:38.577 --> 18:40.096
Do you have to spoil everyone's mood?

18:41.416 --> 18:42.136
Enough.

18:42.136 --> 18:43.136
Am I wrong?

18:51.096 --> 18:52.096
Elders,

18:52.216 --> 18:53.216
I have to leave.

18:55.017 --> 18:56.017
I'll finish this cup.

18:56.256 --> 18:57.256
Do as you please.

18:57.657 --> 18:58.657
Okay.

18:58.777 --> 18:59.456
Alright.

18:59.577 --> 19:00.737
Slow down.

19:01.296 --> 19:02.296
Luzhou.

19:02.776 --> 19:04.097
Drinking too much at once.

19:04.097 --> 19:05.136
Why are you leaving?

19:07.697 --> 19:09.496
Chen Luzhou, that scoundrel.

19:09.977 --> 19:11.456
I thought he loved you so much,

19:11.577 --> 19:13.057
but he didn't even show up.

19:13.937 --> 19:14.937
I announce

19:15.617 --> 19:16.617
he's out.

19:16.617 --> 19:17.697
- Okay, out.
- Out.

19:17.697 --> 19:18.697
Out.

19:20.176 --> 19:24.336
- Bye.
- Bye.

19:25.416 --> 19:26.577
I ordered a ride-hailing car.

19:26.937 --> 19:27.496
Almost here.

19:27.657 --> 19:28.657
I'll send you two back.

19:29.096 --> 19:30.737
No need, my dad is coming to pick me up.

19:30.737 --> 19:31.857
You take Yingying back.

19:31.857 --> 19:33.456
No, I want to go with you.

19:33.977 --> 19:35.176
- Are you okay?
- Okay.

19:35.336 --> 19:36.336
You go back first.

19:38.096 --> 19:39.096
Here it is.

19:40.577 --> 19:41.097
Slow down.

19:41.097 --> 19:42.336
You're really not coming?

19:42.496 --> 19:43.496
You guys go back first.

19:46.937 --> 19:48.017
My heart hurts.

19:48.657 --> 19:50.456
Is it that time for depression again?

19:51.176 --> 19:52.216
How do you know?

19:52.216 --> 19:53.296
Can you read minds?

19:53.416 --> 19:54.416
That's so scary.

19:55.496 --> 19:56.336
We're off.

19:56.336 --> 19:56.857
Okay.

19:57.176 --> 19:57.912
Alright.

19:57.944 --> 19:59.416
- Text me when you're home.
- Okay.

19:59.737 --> 20:00.296
Bye.

20:00.737 --> 20:01.937
Sir, drive slowly.

20:01.937 --> 20:03.496
Happy birthday, Zhi.

20:03.496 --> 20:04.737
Okay, bye.

20:04.737 --> 20:05.536
Bye.

20:05.657 --> 20:06.617
Sir, let's go.

20:06.617 --> 20:07.617
Bye.

20:07.697 --> 20:08.952
- Happy birthday, bye.
- Bye.

20:09.456 --> 20:10.096
Bye.

20:10.096 --> 20:11.096
Alright.

20:50.817 --> 20:51.857
Hello, Dad.

20:52.336 --> 20:54.057
Zhi, happy birthday.

20:54.376 --> 20:55.376
Thank you.

20:56.017 --> 20:57.017
How was the party?

20:57.256 --> 20:59.096
Do you want me to pick you up?

21:01.577 --> 21:02.577
No need.

21:03.216 --> 21:05.096
I'm going for a late-night snack.

21:07.456 --> 21:08.456
Alright then.

21:08.857 --> 21:10.057
Then you guys have fun.

21:10.657 --> 21:11.977
I won't bother you anymore.

21:12.456 --> 21:13.857
My phone's battery is low.

21:13.857 --> 21:14.857
I'll hang up.

21:15.376 --> 21:16.376
Okay, okay.

21:16.617 --> 21:17.617
Happy birthday.

22:00.096 --> 22:02.737
Sorry, the subscriber
you dialed is power off.

22:02.737 --> 22:03.777
Excuse me.

22:03.777 --> 22:05.857
What's Cai Yingying's room number?

22:07.496 --> 22:08.496
They've already left.

22:08.617 --> 22:09.536
Already left?

22:09.536 --> 22:09.937
Yes.

22:09.937 --> 22:10.937
Thank you.

22:25.216 --> 22:26.216
(Mom.)

22:28.977 --> 22:30.017
(What should I do?)

22:31.416 --> 22:33.296
(I think I really like him.)

23:15.456 --> 23:16.456
I'm sorry.

23:17.112 --> 23:22.005
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

23:22.977 --> 23:23.977
I'm late.

23:26.536 --> 23:27.617
Why are you here?

23:27.736 --> 23:30.661
♪A brilliant scenery♪

23:31.608 --> 23:37.295
♪Moonlight spills over
the endless clear sky♪

23:38.200 --> 23:40.817
♪The roar of the heartbeat♪

23:40.817 --> 23:41.817
Happy birthday.

23:42.536 --> 23:43.536
Architect Xu.

23:48.120 --> 23:52.343
♪Crush, rushing to you in the crowd♪

24:46.136 --> 24:47.376
I haven't watched this movie.

24:48.416 --> 24:49.657
You're good at choosing things

24:49.857 --> 24:50.857
every time.

24:51.296 --> 24:53.216
You're lucky as I have this one.

24:55.176 --> 24:56.176
Peach-flavored.

24:56.977 --> 24:58.520
I'll take you back after drinking it.

25:06.536 --> 25:08.617
Why do you seem a bit different today?

25:09.937 --> 25:10.937
You even noticed that?

25:34.416 --> 25:35.977
I'm going to the bathroom.

25:40.344 --> 25:46.407
♪Like a breeze,
drifting through the sky♪

25:48.657 --> 25:49.657
The movie is dull.

25:50.416 --> 25:51.897
Watching from my lap is thrilling.

25:54.616 --> 25:58.577
♪How many sceneries have I passed by♪

25:58.577 --> 26:00.096
I sprained this leg before.

26:00.336 --> 26:01.336
Switch to the other one.

26:01.784 --> 26:05.456
♪Waiting for a meeting♪

26:05.456 --> 26:07.176
Did you shave today?

26:07.412 --> 26:09.848
♪The heartbeat reminds♪

26:10.104 --> 26:13.397
♪The moment of embracing you♪

26:14.008 --> 26:19.640
♪Let every chapter of the story align♪

26:23.472 --> 26:26.341
♪Even if it rains on you♪

26:26.341 --> 26:29.763
♪I will always be with you♪

26:31.256 --> 26:34.048
♪Like a rainbow appears♪

26:34.776 --> 26:37.112
♪Our love will last♪

26:37.273 --> 26:39.960
♪Even if it rains on you♪

26:40.888 --> 26:43.882
♪I will always be with you♪

26:45.195 --> 26:47.535
♪I will let you know♪

26:48.728 --> 26:51.768
♪You're the only one♪

26:53.720 --> 26:58.648
♪When fireworks twinkle
in the night sky♪

27:00.984 --> 27:03.176
♪Igniting the outline of my heartbeat♪

27:03.176 --> 27:04.176
Still want to watch it?

27:04.536 --> 27:05.536
Yes.

27:06.017 --> 27:07.017
Then I'll rewind it.

27:07.737 --> 27:08.256
No need.

27:08.697 --> 27:10.697
Pirrico's dad

27:10.697 --> 27:12.136
bought him a new set of clothes.

27:12.697 --> 27:14.496
But he wasn't happy for long.

27:14.737 --> 27:16.617
His dad sent him to boarding school.

27:19.136 --> 27:20.136
What's wrong?

27:21.176 --> 27:22.336
You were distracted just now?

27:24.136 --> 27:25.136
I'll sign you up

27:25.296 --> 27:27.216
for Guinness World Records
for multitasking.

27:28.136 --> 27:30.216
Can I get a bonus
for breaking the record?

27:32.017 --> 27:33.617
Can I get my dad a new car?

27:36.697 --> 27:37.697
You beat me.

27:39.296 --> 27:40.296
I have to rewind it.

27:40.504 --> 27:43.731
♪I will always be with you♪

27:44.440 --> 27:47.436
♪Like a rainbow appears♪

27:47.864 --> 27:50.584
♪Our love will last♪

27:50.872 --> 27:53.638
♪Even if it rains on you♪

27:53.944 --> 27:57.149
♪I will always be with you♪

27:58.232 --> 28:00.983
♪I will let you know♪

28:01.496 --> 28:04.735
♪You're the only one♪

28:11.617 --> 28:12.697
You saw it just now, right?

28:13.216 --> 28:15.057
That boy wanted
to hold that girl's hand.

28:15.376 --> 28:17.577
His hand shook
more than my grandmother's.

28:18.817 --> 28:20.176
After all, unlike you,

28:20.176 --> 28:21.937
few would go for a kiss immediately.

28:21.937 --> 28:24.216
People usually take things
step by step when dating.

28:24.496 --> 28:25.737
They focus on the process.

28:27.817 --> 28:29.216
You want the process, right?

28:29.216 --> 28:30.456
Okay, I'll make it up to you.

28:36.777 --> 28:37.977
Isn't holding hands enough?

28:38.416 --> 28:39.416
I'll hug you as well.

28:53.897 --> 28:54.937
Chen Luzhou,

28:56.017 --> 28:57.657
your heart is beating so fast.

29:02.536 --> 29:04.376
Last night, Wang Quan
added me on WeChat.

29:06.057 --> 29:06.617
You added him?

29:07.017 --> 29:08.376
I didn't add him the first time.

29:08.376 --> 29:09.376
He added me again.

29:09.777 --> 29:11.737
He asked if I want to be a tutor.

29:12.216 --> 29:13.857
He said if I become a tutor,

29:13.857 --> 29:14.977
and things go smooth,

29:14.977 --> 29:16.096
he would take 20 percent

29:16.096 --> 29:17.897
of commission fee from my salary.

29:19.216 --> 29:20.536
You might as well find Li Ke.

29:21.136 --> 29:22.136
Fair point.

29:22.456 --> 29:24.176
Should I discuss with Wang Quan

29:24.176 --> 29:25.176
about letting that

29:25.376 --> 29:26.536
commission fee be paid to me?

29:26.817 --> 29:27.256
Alright.

29:27.697 --> 29:28.897
If he gives himself to you,

29:28.897 --> 29:29.897
it might work.

29:30.336 --> 29:31.336
Will you give me more?

29:32.456 --> 29:34.536
You can tell Li Ke to pay me

29:34.737 --> 29:35.857
the commission fee,

29:36.456 --> 29:38.057
or perhaps you give yourself to me,

29:38.657 --> 29:40.136
otherwise I'll go with Wang Quan.

29:40.600 --> 29:41.977
You really know your stuff.

29:42.977 --> 29:43.978
Your mind...

29:43.978 --> 29:45.017
Don't become an architect,

29:45.456 --> 29:46.496
and do public relations.

29:46.496 --> 29:47.617
You'll be unstoppable.

29:48.456 --> 29:49.897
But I can't handle scandals.

29:51.376 --> 29:52.536
You should become an artist.

29:52.536 --> 29:53.777
I'll team up with Zhu Yangqi

29:53.777 --> 29:55.336
to make money by selling your scandals,

29:55.496 --> 29:57.336
and then benefit all of us.

29:57.336 --> 29:58.416
Just sacrifice yourself.

29:58.777 --> 30:00.817
Don't worry, I'll support you.

30:01.937 --> 30:02.937
You'll support me?

30:03.697 --> 30:05.296
Once you have the money, you'll be gone.

30:05.296 --> 30:05.938
I know for sure.

30:05.938 --> 30:07.136
Impressive indeed.

30:13.057 --> 30:14.296
No need.

30:15.176 --> 30:16.536
Please rise.

30:16.697 --> 30:17.216
Oh, my.

30:17.697 --> 30:18.697
Come here.

30:22.817 --> 30:24.336
Isn't it inappropriate in public?

30:26.296 --> 30:27.376
My dad is waiting for me.

30:27.817 --> 30:28.817
Did you see that?

30:42.296 --> 30:43.296
Xu.

30:46.336 --> 30:47.577
You've come back at last.

30:47.897 --> 30:49.496
Didn't I tell you not to wait for me?

30:49.496 --> 30:50.577
Why are you still waiting?

30:51.296 --> 30:52.416
What did you eat for dinner?

30:52.577 --> 30:53.577
Barbecue.

30:53.657 --> 30:54.697
Barbecue?

30:55.657 --> 30:57.256
Why is there no smoke smell at all?

30:57.256 --> 30:58.257
What kind of barbecue?

30:58.257 --> 31:00.136
Smokeless barbecue is trendy now.

31:00.416 --> 31:01.817
And there's the deodorizing spray.

31:01.817 --> 31:02.817
It's peach-scented.

31:04.176 --> 31:05.496
I'm allergic to peach, remember?

31:05.496 --> 31:06.617
You're allergic to peaches?

31:07.017 --> 31:08.376
Hurry back and make the call.

31:08.376 --> 31:10.296
Your grandma wants
to wish you a happy birthday.

31:10.697 --> 31:11.697
Okay.

31:53.897 --> 31:55.897
(Shy Boy Chen, good night.)

31:59.136 --> 32:02.057
(Are you sure Shy Boy suits me?)

32:04.416 --> 32:05.416
(It means tsundere one.)

32:07.897 --> 32:09.176
(Did your dad say anything?)

32:12.857 --> 32:15.256
(He said he's got his eye on you.)

32:15.577 --> 32:17.857
(Shy Boy Chen, fend for yourself.)

32:24.657 --> 32:26.096
(I'll come find you tomorrow.)

32:26.336 --> 32:28.657
(Seeing me every day, aren't you tired?)

32:31.057 --> 32:32.057
(Yes.)

32:33.657 --> 32:34.657
(Just kidding with you.)

32:34.937 --> 32:37.136
(Lend me your computer
to check admission results.)

32:37.657 --> 32:39.777
(After all, it's a bit lucky for me.)

32:41.777 --> 32:43.296
(Okay, see you tomorrow.)

32:52.777 --> 32:55.256
Stylish Zhu, just tell me what to do.

32:55.777 --> 32:57.416
Now even unfamiliar classmates

32:57.416 --> 32:59.256
are all asking about our relationship.

32:59.617 --> 33:01.336
How am I supposed
to find a boyfriend now?

33:01.817 --> 33:02.817
What are you afraid of?

33:03.096 --> 33:04.657
Even if you can't marry later,

33:04.657 --> 33:05.937
you still have me.

33:06.296 --> 33:07.336
Stop it.

33:07.336 --> 33:08.777
I'd rather become a nun.

33:09.777 --> 33:10.936
You're overthinking it, okay?

33:10.936 --> 33:12.568
The nunnery might not even want you.

33:12.568 --> 33:14.296
Without master's degree,
you can't join it.

33:14.296 --> 33:15.216
I...

33:18.017 --> 33:19.017
What's going on?

33:19.777 --> 33:20.857
You start to like Yingying?

33:21.496 --> 33:21.897
Well...

33:22.296 --> 33:23.657
That's absolutely impossible.

33:24.216 --> 33:26.216
I have such high standards.
You know that.

33:29.897 --> 33:30.897
Like Cai Yingying?

33:31.336 --> 33:32.336
Absolutely impossible.

33:38.040 --> 33:39.096
- Nice shot.
- Nice shot.

33:39.256 --> 33:39.536
Nice.

33:39.536 --> 33:40.536
Nice shot.

33:41.496 --> 33:42.496
Nice shot.

33:47.615 --> 33:50.002
(Okay, see you tomorrow.)

33:55.136 --> 33:56.136
Hey.

33:57.737 --> 33:58.376
I...

33:58.536 --> 33:59.737
I'm off, you guys play.

34:00.216 --> 34:00.817
Play next time.

34:01.136 --> 34:02.136
- Bye.
- You are leaving?

34:07.536 --> 34:08.536
Zhu.

34:08.657 --> 34:09.857
Luzhou is acting weird.

34:10.057 --> 34:11.096
How's that?

34:11.096 --> 34:12.857
He just smiled at the phone.

34:13.897 --> 34:14.897
Really?

34:15.617 --> 34:16.617
Yes.

34:16.897 --> 34:18.336
When doesn't he smile at his phone?

34:18.937 --> 34:20.136
But today, his smile

34:20.617 --> 34:21.617
is extra bright.

34:21.857 --> 34:22.937
Yes, I saw it too.

34:23.657 --> 34:24.657
Really?

34:25.256 --> 34:26.697
If I'm not mistaken,

34:27.657 --> 34:29.057
he's like you now,

34:29.416 --> 34:31.897
secretly dating behind my back.

34:32.697 --> 34:33.737
Who's dating?

34:36.697 --> 34:38.256
Right, I'm dating now.

34:40.057 --> 34:42.977
I think Lucy

34:43.737 --> 34:45.057
should be looking at his photos.

34:45.897 --> 34:47.536
He's still single.

34:57.416 --> 34:58.377
If you're curious,

34:58.377 --> 35:02.136
you can check my search history
and see what I'm usually searching.

35:02.657 --> 35:03.657
Can I?

35:04.416 --> 35:05.416
Go ahead.

35:09.136 --> 35:10.136
(Xu Zhi,)

35:10.536 --> 35:13.057
(please keep up this keen curiosity.)

35:13.657 --> 35:15.697
(Perhaps the next Nobel Prize winner
from China)

35:15.697 --> 35:16.697
(is you.)

35:18.697 --> 35:19.977
Chen Luzhou, you are a dog.

35:20.817 --> 35:21.857
Reward me with a bone?

35:21.857 --> 35:23.617
Alright, wait at the door.

35:23.617 --> 35:25.697
I'll give you a big bone, Doggy Chen.

35:26.096 --> 35:27.096
Thank you.

35:28.376 --> 35:29.376
Hurry up and check.

35:39.577 --> 35:40.577
Okay.

35:40.777 --> 35:41.777
I'll do it.

35:52.657 --> 35:53.657
Wait.

35:54.136 --> 35:55.456
I only told you once, right?

35:55.697 --> 35:56.456
And you remembered.

35:56.577 --> 35:57.577
Your memory is excellent.

35:57.737 --> 35:59.617
Was 713 guy called for nothing?

36:03.577 --> 36:04.857
Why is it closed?

36:05.136 --> 36:06.136
Keep it a mystery.

36:10.577 --> 36:11.577
Not in a hurry at all.

36:11.857 --> 36:13.376
I'll find out sooner or later.

36:15.456 --> 36:16.456
Buy the ticket.

36:16.897 --> 36:17.897
680 yuan.

36:20.256 --> 36:21.256
School of Architecture.

36:23.777 --> 36:24.777
Not happy?

36:26.817 --> 36:27.817
I heard

36:29.136 --> 36:31.017
the winter in Beijing is very dry.

36:31.536 --> 36:33.057
Will I have a nosebleed if I go there?

36:35.617 --> 36:37.176
Not the time to think about this now.

36:38.536 --> 36:39.096
Let's go.

36:39.456 --> 36:40.456
I'll get you a big bone.

36:40.824 --> 36:42.296
I'll get out to get changed.

36:42.536 --> 36:43.536
Wait a moment.

36:43.857 --> 36:45.057
Why not let me see?

36:46.256 --> 36:47.336
You have a glib tongue.

36:49.336 --> 36:50.336
Well...

36:51.416 --> 36:52.657
How about tomorrow

36:53.017 --> 36:54.096
we go swimming?

36:55.777 --> 36:56.777
You wish.

36:58.456 --> 36:59.937
I can't even take a look at abs.

37:00.176 --> 37:01.256
So petty.

37:11.617 --> 37:13.416
Boys should be reserved.

37:14.456 --> 37:15.216
What do you mean?

37:15.216 --> 37:16.216
You don't want to see?

37:18.017 --> 37:21.017
Fine, I am not reserved.
I'm worthless, okay?

37:22.496 --> 37:23.496
Sure, no more teasing.

37:23.577 --> 37:24.857
I'll be a tutor tomorrow.

37:24.937 --> 37:25.937
I have to go back.

37:29.617 --> 37:31.057
In the coming days,

37:31.057 --> 37:32.096
I might be very busy.

37:32.697 --> 37:34.336
We might not often see each other.

37:34.777 --> 37:35.777
I'll come to see Li Ke

37:36.496 --> 37:37.897
and let him fire you, okay?

37:37.977 --> 37:38.977
That won't do.

37:39.336 --> 37:40.456
We've signed a contract.

37:41.136 --> 37:42.136
I'm leaving.

37:44.216 --> 37:45.216
Don't miss me too much.

37:47.176 --> 37:47.496
You...

37:47.577 --> 37:48.577
Bye.

37:52.777 --> 37:55.136
(Flirting and then running right away?)

38:04.136 --> 38:05.136
Focus on reading.

38:05.737 --> 38:06.737
Don't get distracted.

38:16.697 --> 38:18.296
(Still busy, Zhi?)

38:24.216 --> 38:27.057
(So busy, on a break.)

38:31.896 --> 38:32.803
(Liu Tongqian)

38:40.136 --> 38:41.136
Liu Tongqian.

38:42.296 --> 38:43.296
You know her?

38:43.777 --> 38:45.216
Xu Zhi is teaching her.

38:46.617 --> 38:48.536
Is this girl you like?

38:48.817 --> 38:51.216
Her name is Liu Tongqian.

38:51.817 --> 38:52.937
Don't call her Qian.

38:54.096 --> 38:55.737
Lots of people have this name.

38:55.817 --> 38:56.817
Why do you care?

38:57.256 --> 38:58.296
Fine.

38:58.296 --> 38:59.937
Then I'll call you girlfriend

39:00.336 --> 39:01.336
a nickname from now on.

39:01.897 --> 39:02.897
I'll call her

39:03.136 --> 39:04.456
darling.

39:04.977 --> 39:06.176
Fine, call her if you dare.

39:08.857 --> 39:09.857
Focus on reading.

39:19.057 --> 39:20.057
Tomorrow, Shall we go

39:20.617 --> 39:21.617
to the sculpture show?

39:21.777 --> 39:22.777
I can't go.

39:23.057 --> 39:24.857
Qian is about to attend a competition.

39:26.496 --> 39:27.496
Such a full schedule.

39:27.777 --> 39:29.296
You think I am free?

39:29.937 --> 39:32.496
Schedule an appointment with me
two days in advance next time.

39:34.296 --> 39:35.296
Alright.

39:35.456 --> 39:36.817
I'll find someone else.

39:37.456 --> 39:38.496
Go ahead.

39:38.496 --> 39:39.496
If you go alone,

39:39.496 --> 39:40.256
then you're a dog.

39:40.416 --> 39:41.456
Got to go.

39:41.456 --> 39:42.456
Bye.

40:05.456 --> 40:06.456
Zhi.

40:06.577 --> 40:07.296
How's it going?

40:07.577 --> 40:09.336
Found someone
to join you at the exhibition?

40:10.897 --> 40:12.176
She is on the way.

40:13.416 --> 40:16.296
Doggy Chen, how's the exhibition?

40:16.777 --> 40:17.777
It's alright.

40:18.136 --> 40:19.256
I think you'll like it.

40:20.057 --> 40:21.057
Really?

40:21.176 --> 40:22.697
You're not mocking me, are you?

40:23.296 --> 40:25.456
Did you see something special?

40:26.176 --> 40:27.176
Nude man.

40:28.256 --> 40:29.296
Knight.

40:29.296 --> 40:30.296
And a rose.

40:31.096 --> 40:32.096
Use your imagination.

40:32.416 --> 40:34.176
Are you lying to me?

40:36.456 --> 40:37.496
Lifelike.

40:37.496 --> 40:38.817
It's a pity you didn't come.

40:40.496 --> 40:41.496
Alright.

40:42.136 --> 40:43.897
Aren't you going to Dunhuang soon?

40:43.897 --> 40:44.977
Shall we meet tonight?

40:45.977 --> 40:46.977
Whatever you say.

40:47.536 --> 40:48.536
Okay.

41:11.864 --> 41:13.848
(Knights and Roses)
(Author, Misan Dhano)

41:13.848 --> 41:15.528
(I'm the knight with severed hands,)

41:15.528 --> 41:18.232
(but it doesn't affect
the freshness of the rose.)

41:28.897 --> 41:29.897
What's wrong?

41:30.777 --> 41:31.977
Can I take a shower first?

41:35.136 --> 41:36.697
I'm very tired today.

41:37.416 --> 41:38.456
Let me hold you longer.

41:43.416 --> 41:46.496
Although working for a few days,
it feels like you've worked for years.

41:47.416 --> 41:48.416
What do you think?

41:48.897 --> 41:50.456
Working ages me quickly.

41:57.057 --> 41:58.216
Why do you smell like coffee?

42:00.657 --> 42:01.697
I...

42:01.697 --> 42:04.456
I bought a coffee on the way back.
I spilled it accidentally.

42:05.577 --> 42:07.057
Otherwise, I thought I was drooling.

42:07.977 --> 42:09.256
That is not the case.

42:09.336 --> 42:10.737
You are tight-mouthed.

42:11.017 --> 42:12.017
You even know this.

42:16.824 --> 42:19.439
♪The world is too quiet♪

42:20.248 --> 42:22.296
♪Amplify every sound♪

42:22.296 --> 42:23.577
So, you do know how to kiss.

42:25.176 --> 42:26.256
What can't I do?

42:28.937 --> 42:30.256
Chen Luzhou, open the door.

42:30.617 --> 42:31.617
I'm here.

42:32.017 --> 42:32.617
Zhu Yangqi.

42:32.617 --> 42:33.377
Hurry up.

42:33.377 --> 42:34.456
I heard you fart.

42:40.216 --> 42:41.897
I'm going to get a band-aid.

42:51.176 --> 42:52.176
Zhi is here too.

42:55.136 --> 42:56.136
What are you doing?

42:56.857 --> 42:57.857
Watch the game with you.

43:11.336 --> 43:12.336
What's that?

43:18.777 --> 43:19.857
Do you really think

43:19.857 --> 43:21.136
I don't know what that is?

43:24.456 --> 43:25.617
You think I can't tell?

43:27.216 --> 43:27.658
Zhi.

43:27.658 --> 43:29.304
I have something to do. I will leave.

43:31.136 --> 43:31.737
I'll send her.

43:31.737 --> 43:32.737
Suit yourself.

43:40.296 --> 43:41.336
You bad guy.

43:41.817 --> 43:43.577
You started dating and didn't tell me.

43:44.096 --> 43:45.096
Well...

44:09.976 --> 44:13.784
(I'm the knight with severed hands,)

44:13.784 --> 44:21.400
(but it doesn't affect
the freshness of the rose.)

44:23.704 --> 44:29.520
♪Like a cloud drifting away♪

44:30.072 --> 44:35.600
♪Freely crossing the vast sky♪

44:37.112 --> 44:41.560
♪The world is too quiet♪

44:42.552 --> 44:49.480
♪Amplifying all the sounds♪

44:50.392 --> 44:55.480
♪Who will visit me♪

44:56.536 --> 45:02.160
♪Treading carefully
into my personal space♪

45:02.904 --> 45:05.960
♪Turning the frozen loneliness♪

45:06.200 --> 45:11.520
♪Into concern and care♪

45:17.048 --> 45:22.160
♪Watching stars rise and fall♪

45:22.680 --> 45:28.520
♪Gently pushing me to tour your world♪

45:29.976 --> 45:33.360
♪Swirling into a vortex♪

45:33.496 --> 45:39.720
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

45:40.216 --> 45:43.160
♪The lonely clock♪

45:43.320 --> 45:47.920
♪A relentless pursuit, day and night♪

45:48.312 --> 45:51.560
♪Are we both♪

45:51.832 --> 45:55.360
♪Attracted to each other♪

45:56.504 --> 46:03.120
♪Falling into you♪

46:06.840 --> 46:12.640
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

46:13.496 --> 46:16.160
♪Just a few more embraces away♪

46:16.696 --> 46:21.320
♪From reaching eternity♪

46:21.720 --> 46:25.000
♪After rushing recklessly♪

46:25.208 --> 46:28.640
♪We approach each other♪

46:29.912 --> 46:33.520
♪Without turning back♪

46:34.904 --> 46:42.560
♪In your eyes, I see myself♪

46:43.192 --> 46:49.680
♪Falling into you♪
